RF Deep Dig licensing
=====================

This repository contains material under different terms. It is not licensed
as a whole under Apache-2.0.

1. Existing releases and third-party material

The source baseline is chimph/deep-dig commit
2d5466a118cb93bf1f5c6160424cb98e9a2a25ec, previously published with an
Apache-2.0 repository licence. All Apache-2.0 permissions already granted
for that material remain available, including commercial reuse subject to
that licence. Moving it to this repository does not revoke or narrow those
permissions, including for unchanged copies included here.

FriendSDK source, including the runtime in src/, retains Apache-2.0.
See LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt. Third-party code, artwork and fonts retain their
own terms regardless of location. See NOTICE.md and
games/deep-dig/fonts/Silkscreen-OFL.txt.

2. New original Deep Dig material

Only new original Deep Dig material first introduced after the baseline,
and for which chimph holds the relevant rights, is covered by
LICENSES/Deep-Dig-Evaluation.txt unless explicitly licensed otherwise.
This includes new game code, original game assets, game-specific tooling,
tests and documentation. It excludes the baseline material, FriendSDK
runtime code, third-party material and anything separately licensed.
For mixed files, the evaluation terms apply only to the new original
portions, not to existing Apache-2.0 portions.

The evaluation terms allow inspection, private testing and judging, but
require separate permission for commercial reuse or public hosting of
covered new material. They are source-available terms, not an open-source
licence. Existing Apache-2.0 rights remain unaffected.

3. Contact and ownership

Builder: chimph. Contact: https://x.com/intocryptoast
No ownership transfer, exclusivity or official Rare Friends endorsement is
created by publishing this repository or making it available for evaluation.
No rights in third-party names or trademarks are granted by these terms.
